>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=97 valign=top style='width:72.75pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>KIT USED<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=24 colspan=2 valign=top style='width:18.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>:<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=455 colspan=2 valign=top style='width:341.25pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.6pt'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:10.0pt'>HCV TRI \u2013 DOT TEST CARD<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=97 valign=top style='width:72.75pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>MFG BY<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=24 colspan=2 valign=top style='width:18.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>:<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=455 colspan=2 valign=top style='width:341.25pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.6pt'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>DIAGNOSTIC\r\n  ENTERPRISES <\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=97 valign=top style='width:72.75pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>LOT NO.<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=24 colspan=2 valign=top style='width:18.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>:<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=455 colspan=2 valign=top style='width:341.25pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>HCD072335<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr height=0>\r\n  <td width=97 style='border:none'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=15 style='border:none'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=9 style='border:none'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=37 style='border:none'><\/td>\r\n  <td width=397 style='border:none'><\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span\r\n style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span\r\n style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span\r\n style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><u><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>NOTE:<\/span><\/u><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'> <\/span><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Hepatitis\r\nC Virus (HCV) was identified in 1989 as the main aetiological agent of non-A,\r\nnon-B hepatitis (<b>NANBH<\/b>) accounting for greater than 90% of\r\npost-transfusion hepatitis cases. HCV is a spherical virus of about 30-60 nm in\r\ndiameter with single positive stranded RNA and is related to the family\r\nflaviviridae. It is considered to be the major cause of acute chronic\r\nhepatitis, liver cirrhosis and hepatocellular carcinoma throughout the world.\r\nIt is therefore necessary to correctly diagnose Hepatitis C infection.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>The test for\r\nantibodies to HCV was proved to be highly valuable in the diagnosis and study\r\nof the infection, especially in the early diagnosis of HCV after transfusion.\r\nThe diagnosis of hepatitis C can be easily made by finding elevated serum ALT\r\nlevels and presence of anti-HCV in serum\/plasma.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>DRAWN SAMPLE FROM OUTSIDE<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Remarks: It is a screening test.<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Suggested confirmation by ELISA\/CLIA assay.<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/div>","page":{"size":"595.45pt 841.7pt","margin":"151.2pt 36.0pt 72.0pt 36.0pt"}}